### Owner: Geraldine  ·  TS02, TS06, TS15 and product detail
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### TS02 stock of a product
GET {{baseUrl}}/productos/1/stock

### Detail: product + sensor + last 5 readings
GET {{baseUrl}}/productos/3/detalle

### TS06 comparison of every product (MATCH / DISCREPANCY / REGISTERED_ONLY)
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventario/comparacion

### TS06 comparison of one product
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventario/comparacion/3

### Product that does not exist -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/inventario/comparacion/999

### TS15 movements of a period
GET {{baseUrl}}/movimientos-stock?desde=2026-11-01&hasta=2026-11-30

### Period without movements -> 200 and []
GET {{baseUrl}}/movimientos-stock?desde=2020-01-01&hasta=2020-01-31
